		(uuid "beee709b-1ed5-4753-b799-a6e5522692d3")
	)
	(text "BR2: discrete Schottky bridge D105-D108 (D2PAK tabs = cathodes: D105/D106 on the +5V_RAW pour, D107/D108 on the AC pours)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 289.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c9dab615-c57a-4f85-bfd2-5a9a9d2d857d")
	)
	(text "+5V raw supply (9VAC)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 247.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cdf4717a-b404-4aa9-aca2-8b2026566cba")
	)
	(text "BR5: discrete Schottky bridge D113-D116 (D2PAK tabs = cathodes: D113/D114 on the +12VU pour, D115/D116 on the AC pours)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 167.64 359.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20a8be71-93e8-4188-b9c2-50979473619e")
	)
	(text "+12V POWER (unregulated, 9.8VAC): motors, optos, coin door, DMD - J116/J117/J118"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 317.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "75a3dc1e-69e5-4bb0-8277-2a23acdc1d98")
	)
	(text "Power supplies (windings per manual/pinwiki: 9 VAC red -> +5V, 13.3 VAC blu-wht -> +18V, 16 VAC wht-red -> +20V, 51 VAC blk-yel -> \"+50V\" (~70 V DC),\n9.8 VAC wht-grn -> +12V power). Each secondary is fused (F111-F114, F116; F112 is SMT TA7, others 5x20 mm) before its bridge: GBPC2506W block (BR3, 6223BG basket heatsink); the +18V (D101-D104),\nBR1 D101-D104 use MBR40100A TO-220AB with individual 577202B00000G heatsinks; D105-D116 retain MBRB20H100CTT4G D2PAK diodes on copper pours. +50V (4 x 1000uF/100V, bleeder R259||R260) feeds the coils through F103/F104/F105 (J107-1 also feeds the 8-driver board).\n+20V (BR4/C11) feeds the flashlamps only (coin-door interlock kills +20V/+50V). +18V (BR1/C6/C7) feeds the lamp matrix AND the +12V digital buck-boost U21 (0.75 A load; 1.52 A nominal current limit,\nF115 3/4 A -> J114 to CPU J210 / Fliptronic J904 / 8-driver, as the original 7812 did). +12V power (BR5/C30+C63 9400uF, unregulated, F116) -> J116/J117/J118 pin 2\n(coin door, DMD controller, playfield optos and the STTNG gun motors). +5V: BR2 -> C5 -> TPS552872-Q1 U20 (5.1 V, 3 A load; 3.85 A nominal current limit) -> J114/J116/J117/J118.\nLED1 +12V digital, LED2 +12V after F115, LED4 +5V, LED5 +20V, LED6 +18V, LED7 +12V power. TP1 12V power, TP2 5V, TP3 12V digital, TP5 GND, TP6 50V, TP7 20V, TP8 18V, TP9 5V raw."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8d7f86b6-652a-40a3-9e1b-4c7f5c070da9")
	)
